 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "A quasi-finite scheme over a quasi-affine base is quasi-affine",
 "statement": "Let $f\\colon X\\to Y$ be separated, quasi-compact, locally quasi-finite and\nlocally of finite type, and suppose $Y$ is quasi-affine. Then $X$ is\nquasi-affine.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-nagata-compactification/sk-prop-nagata-sketch-zmt/lemma-nagata-zmt-quasi-affine-source.md",
